{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "978ae30efe45006794288c76f83c02ad267fd271d930fcecdcce2e9ca972c1fb", "ja": "（昨日の今日だからか、みんな少し気まずそうだな。\n俺から話をしようか……）", "zh": "（也许是因为昨天的事，大家之间的气氛有点僵呢，\n就由我来开口吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3d60eaf74c9488dbd0f92076f5a90ec77706d1d1803dddb1e6975f068f5fa65f", "ja": "みんな、集まってくれてありがとう。\nそれじゃ、聞いてくれ。志保は……。", "zh": "谢谢各位过来这里，\n那么，听我说，志保她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "48aa5651c2ae7d946b4e60e7fe010569ec547ee60b91d67fd751918f87b682a6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大丈夫です。\n私、自分で話します。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，没问题的。\n我会自己说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65272c49c678b8bbba915fd5ed4ea744c6401e1bcf6d6d3c3ffbc0e492000f77", "ja": "志保……そうか。", "zh": "志保……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "09e42b8db3817b8a1e42c786a57f9d71f552ae70eb41950867f8ccb9696b83a7", "ja": "志保……その、ユニットやめたいって言ったの？\n{$P$}に。", "zh": "志保……你对{$P$}说了\n要退出团体吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "3db325635ff2117cd0bf0022bd6be4c8136654f98c5cf0c2a5787fb2361be9f5", "ja": "……言ったわ。", "zh": "……我说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "519cfcc142a6387357fbdb5d22ffaab6002fabd3ac302da6700e163ad5c15990", "ja": "い……今も、そう思ってるの……？", "zh": "你……你现在还是这么想吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "538749aa8df9cbf85793d55aa5a8547538dc37d455fe12c3fc5e256040d4981b", "ja": "志保さん、やめたりしませんよね？\nわたし、志保さんと一緒にステージに立ちたいです！", "zh": "志保姊姊，你不会退出吧？\n我想和志保姊姊一起站上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "5a511771ba3a0fb2593f8ee3261937c56c1063a7bca17b24a544a22bb4d6211c", "ja": "まだ、ダンスは下手ですけど……でも、\nできるようになるまで、ちゃんと練習します！", "zh": "虽然我的舞还跳得不好……但是，\n我会好好练习到会跳为止的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "794ddb101db27edca743e5283faa59bccfea31594bd63a7228bb5cb56ad38103", "ja": "星梨花……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "48f49f1caaa2aaabf733de1ff936a379f4b488a2069c8a40a25350e64d39a537", "ja": "私は……できれば、クレシェンドブルーの\nメンバーとして、ステージに立ちたいと思ってる。", "zh": "我……如果可以的话，想以「Crescendo Blue」\n成员的身份站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "4fc657d8f68120fdce21995b247d309ea9a7ccfa60c3c4c4366e3b7abc4e0111", "ja": "！　志保……それ、本当？", "zh": "！志保……你说的是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "bf843cf6793878d3a608c3620f48757f6585ef7e8fd122a0c7b3f27694ff4a33", "ja": "ええ。でもそれと同じくらい、\n下手なものをお客さんに見せたくない。", "zh": "是的，但同样地，我也不想\n让观众看到不像样的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef1a6e7ef373eec8ef2516c06cc81c9309b6a7ca3037baa2e8d1f934d689b87d", "ja": "このユニットは、トップアイドルを目指すには\n大きなチャンスだわ。だから……。", "zh": "为了成为顶尖偶像，这团体是个\n大好机会，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6ba274aaca2696319dbc19bd1e00163bce3d0cd00489e413ef0f60b0fead2d2", "ja": "それは、私達だって同じだわ！\nみんな同じことを考えて……だから……。", "zh": "我也是这么想的呀！\n大家的想法都一样……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "b5178708b7dd670a79317e5f18a1b963220d525127b6af745e13d79ffcf3714c", "ja": "……そうみたいね。", "zh": "……似乎是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "b168b76fd1062094ed5d5a531e99b03600e044760f294db44308275d91becb0a", "ja": "でも、だったら先に言えばよかったのに。\n「星梨花の門限があるから練習は延長できない」って。", "zh": "但要是能先跟我说就好了，\n告诉我「因为星梨花有门禁，不能延长练习」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "8ad749fa249db72bce592e956fd73d2aed14a4f6ad1ed8f8b0e1e67983b20608", "ja": "それは……ごめんなさい。志保がいつも黙って\n先に帰るから、何だか言い出せなくて……。", "zh": "那个……对不起，因为志保总是默默地\n一个人先离开，总觉得有点难开口……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "8e119602750f341ac7ab9aa257caf3ec221c4999467561dda1b3483955de79a4", "ja": "志保が弟さんを迎えに行ってたこと、\n知ってたらよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "要是知道志保是\n去接弟弟就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "9a2c1e2a1b8705a52416e91eb9d82a9483b9632e34a4591ba60cde69c25bbe84", "ja": "弟のことを理由に、遠慮されたくなかったから。\n……逆効果だったみたいだけど。", "zh": "因为我不想把弟弟当理由，让大家对我客气……\n看来造成反效果了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1ca563923b8edb0d7e36759770a4374f6d99d1b8998b4e61fab458ceff97bb0a", "ja": "静香も志保も、お互いに心配をかけさせまいとして、\nすれ違ってしまったんだな。", "zh": "静香和志保都不想让彼此担心，\n因而产生误会了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "61dcef311901ae3f380059b768125d369507f2e6d830e7312a86f90104199365", "ja": "わかるよ～茜ちゃんにはわかる！　完全に理解した！\nモガミンの気持ちも、しほりんの気持ちもね……！", "zh": "太懂了～小茜非常懂！完全理解了！\n无论是静香香的心情，还是志保保的心情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "77efc0404bc9a8cb47989ee9c14b87d05545f95d1b321b79d29ed1471edc9509", "ja": "はぁ……茜さんが、何を理解したのか、\n私にはわかりませんが……。", "zh": "唉……我倒是不懂\n茜到底是理解了什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "df1f1a4020a9c528cf472db33dafa260b773db6d46b24378acba6d352d7cc9d1", "ja": "茜さんと麗花さんが、ユニットの仲を近づけようと\nしていたんだってことは、わかりました。", "zh": "但我了解了茜和丽花都是希望\n团体的感情能更融洽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "9c6887f226066a4775b0a357751fb8c163f28ce80d53348a1452a677af920a32", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんだ！？\n茜ちゃんすごいね、えらいえらい♪", "zh": "咦，原来是这样喔！？\n小茜好厉害喔，了不起了不起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8e1abfc1ce0c92b46b0e19c7026971991212dd7111e18043b53c21c5b4080598", "ja": "麗花……。", "zh": "丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "6d319eaa6b53c22d609ad93c2fece280250dc991f19b5233033b2f2c3273cb23", "ja": "麗花ちゃん……\n今ので、なんかいろいろ台無しだよ……！", "zh": "小丽花……\n你刚刚似乎让很多事都白费了啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d90950a06a669e9b76f071997950765303d96595e8e402959751b214ae2cbbd", "ja": "全員が、クレシェンドブルーのことを\n一番に考えていたんですね！　よかったです……。", "zh": "所有人都是把「Crescendo Blue」\n摆在第一顺位呢！太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "67f5a98c4dfeb58e410cd4d91a4d2b5234dc30ab07ccc7c14616a08cb90e4e02", "ja": "ふふっ……そうみたいね！　えっと、それじゃあ……。\n志保、握手しよう。仲直りの握手！", "zh": "呵呵……看来没错呢！我想想，那么……\n志保，我们握手吧，和好的握手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "5362e20c15573cbf011d35666c8e7f77f087b3e072594d4e03b0ee169851d6b2", "ja": "え？　まあ、いいけど……ふふっ。", "zh": "咦？嗯，也是可以……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "1133d732b7e5e575e91bd0b3a15b74a1548e70e4a7e3b88e820e0531c38b7c93", "ja": "何？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "4f5fcd0a2e8d2e22d2e054198857c19645d6ec41beddb0cfaac0c20ddee1852e", "ja": "小学生のケンカみたい。", "zh": "好像小学生吵架一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "87d24134207048b6c0a3046d723cf718a3aacec4596258d671c6157b97830181", "ja": "い……いいでしょ、別に！　ほら！", "zh": "这……这无所谓吧！好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "d5b6b487561bf6aabf6df521f9529bdba6be4140d23673b59f604c80bfbbc0b4", "ja": "よし。これで仲直りは、無事完了だな。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "好，这样就顺利和好了呢，\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1037_022ser", "source_sha256": "7df366cab3c24d718b018590365f55950cd566749868b189dbb175d9cc60cc11", "ja": "はい！\nまたみんなで、一緒に頑張れるんですね！", "zh": "是的！\n大家又可以一起加油了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "6b285a34f921d1bc6242ef611d14cdfa316026344bf265c5734e69d404ab9b75", "ja": "ええ……でも、やるからには本気だから。\nレッスンは今までどおり、遠慮しないわ。", "zh": "是啊……但既然要做就要认真做。\n训练课程就像之前一样，我不会客气的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "f93708f1917a2eea797ab9f2c991c90de1609b55d23457bd47cada1b6c7ab154", "ja": "そりゃもう！　茜ちゃんはいつだって本気だよ！\nほら、見て見てこのやる気に満ちた表情！", "zh": "那是当然！小茜时时刻刻都是认真的喔！\n来，你看看这干劲满满的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac9c7eea7209e84e8d209f2a8a21e5ace3dd2ccc380453147ddbcaf5481cc02c", "ja": "志保。気持ちはわかるけど、野々原さんもこう見えて\nみんなのこと考えてくれてたみたいだから……。", "zh": "志保，我懂你的心情，野野原虽然看起来是这样，\n似乎也是为了大家着想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "578fc5d9519448c95da302b87be0b6a3106da03bb3233d66da07b93930427d81", "ja": "アレ！？　モガミンなんで今フォロー入ったの！？", "zh": "奇怪！？静香香刚刚怎么帮小茜说话了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "d488229b4d864e9a6dafb9266e892fc4d8b09d765cf96e277b4682eaf060505a", "ja": "わかってるわ。\nただ漫才は、よくわからなかったけど……。", "zh": "我知道的，\n但我还是不太懂相声就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "44153bd8f3116a401e770c4a0d542ca6c086ed8e4881f3b60d812f5c2f0d5665", "ja": "う～ん……そうだ！\n志保ちゃんも、私達の漫才に加わってみない？", "zh": "唔……对了！\n小志保要不要也加入我们的相声？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1046_023aka", "source_sha256": "764b683b0c3459e09ba9ed06bf1862e08a19b9891b53974b8b4a6a37b4085543", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、ナイス！\nささ、しほりん！　こっちこっち！", "zh": "小丽花，Nice！\n来来，志保保！这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_06_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "653c26370d9d1321bccfdb20d8150e680678dfd03d9a822acaa0e4d029e1e074", "ja": "い、いえ、私は……\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "不、不，我……\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
